@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    ``AttemptManager`` now supports the async context manager protocol, so
+    ``async with attempt:`` works inside ``async for attempt in AsyncRetrying(...)``
+    loops. It behaves exactly like ``with attempt:``.
